  "details": "Steps to reproduce: \n- Make custom mirror shader with something animate-able, such as opacity. \n\n- Make animator for Material, and create an animation that changes the newly made Opacity slider. \n\n- Mirror will not react to animators changes, but will react to manual changes through the inspector. \n\nUse Case:\n- A transparent mirror for glass, with a UI slider to control the intensity of the reflections.\n\n* Mirrors are not marked as static in any way. ",
